WEBVTT

01:28.150 --> 01:32.150
Our Secret
EP05

02:26.969 --> 02:28.610
What are you doing up so late？

02:34.080 --> 02:35.130
I'm going to sleep.

02:35.610 --> 02:36.520
Come on.

03:09.920 --> 03:11.050
Someone says

03:12.210 --> 03:13.560
the people who accompany you

03:13.800 --> 03:15.560
through the zero point into the new year

03:17.160 --> 03:18.770
will be by your side

03:18.770 --> 03:19.890
in the coming year.

03:23.160 --> 03:25.520
I hope whoever says that

03:27.080 --> 03:28.250
doesn't lie to me.

03:38.969 --> 03:40.160
They're selling Kongming lanterns.

03:40.520 --> 03:41.130
Come on.

03:42.280 --> 03:44.080
How do you find this place?

03:44.410 --> 03:45.250
When I was young,

03:45.330 --> 03:46.850
my mom used to bring me here.

03:52.360 --> 03:53.800
You are so happy.

03:54.000 --> 03:55.360
Xianxian, let's write this.

03:56.000 --> 03:56.850
Come on.

03:58.210 --> 03:58.850
Let's do it.

03:58.850 --> 03:59.850
You go there to write.

04:01.640 --> 04:02.640
You're too naive.

04:14.850 --> 04:15.640
Let me take a look.

04:15.800 --> 04:17.050
No, go away.

04:17.530 --> 04:19.000
You are so stingy.

04:20.120 --> 04:21.050
Let's write it.

04:38.810 --> 04:40.049
What do you wish for?

04:43.090 --> 04:44.049
I wish

04:44.890 --> 04:47.280
I wouldn't be your deskmate next semester.

04:49.610 --> 04:50.400
If I'm your deskmate

04:50.560 --> 04:51.840
next semester,

04:52.330 --> 04:53.960
your Kongming lantern won't work.

04:55.000 --> 04:56.160
I wish really hard, and I'll get what I want.

04:56.680 --> 04:58.090
Xianxian, don't talk to him.

05:00.610 --> 05:01.680
Go away.

05:03.370 --> 05:04.210
Come on.

05:06.050 --> 05:09.440
Three, two, one...

05:42.330 --> 05:44.770
I hope I still can be

05:44.770 --> 05:45.890
Zhou Siyue's deskmate.

05:46.330 --> 05:48.049
I hope I still can be

05:48.810 --> 05:49.890
Ding Xian's deskmate.

06:01.840 --> 06:02.840
What are you humming?

06:03.050 --> 06:04.090
That's terrible.

06:05.050 --> 06:06.000
You don't understand.

06:06.090 --> 06:06.930
It's called B-Box.

06:07.000 --> 06:08.210
Few people can do it.

06:08.370 --> 06:09.330
I've been practicing for so long.

06:09.560 --> 06:11.000
I won't do it if you don't want to listen.

06:14.050 --> 06:15.090
I don't care.

06:15.650 --> 06:16.840
I don't want to hear it.

06:17.090 --> 06:18.330
I've always wanted to change a deskmate.

06:19.610 --> 06:20.370
Really?

06:22.440 --> 06:23.400
That's too bad.

06:23.770 --> 06:24.680
I made a wish

06:25.090 --> 06:26.530
to still be your deskmate.

06:27.680 --> 06:28.770
Really?

06:29.370 --> 06:30.330
I'm kidding you.

06:30.840 --> 06:31.810
You are getting on my nerves.

06:31.930 --> 06:32.720
I'll never speak to you again.

06:32.720 --> 06:33.280
No, no, no.

06:33.530 --> 06:37.049
My wish is to have a new game console.

06:37.210 --> 06:40.120
But the wish to be your deskmate

06:40.330 --> 06:41.210
is true.

06:44.560 --> 06:45.560
Don't be angry anymore.

06:46.960 --> 06:48.000
You're so stupid.

06:50.240 --> 06:51.680
I've told you my wish.

06:51.930 --> 06:53.400
Can you tell me your wish?

06:53.650 --> 06:54.930
I won't tell you.

07:06.650 --> 07:07.490
Xianxian

07:08.000 --> 07:09.050
Are you OK?

07:11.000 --> 07:12.890
You can ask the teacher for a leave.

07:15.770 --> 07:17.370
I'm in the examination room now.

07:18.530 --> 07:20.210
I should have listened to my mother

07:20.770 --> 07:22.210
and wear more.

07:28.400 --> 07:29.680
I have already told you.

07:34.090 --> 07:35.930
I'm done this time.

07:36.680 --> 07:38.400
It's okay. Just do your best.

08:28.490 --> 08:29.720
Choose A for the sixth question.

08:31.210 --> 08:33.090
I got it wrong. English exam is over.

08:33.330 --> 08:34.290
We're free.

08:37.290 --> 08:38.240
I'm screwed.

08:43.090 --> 08:44.559
Almost as I estimated.

08:45.730 --> 08:48.000
Are you sure you made all the right choices?

08:48.730 --> 08:50.410
Look who your deskmate is.

08:52.170 --> 08:53.770
I'm over.

08:54.120 --> 08:56.650
I have to spend my vacation in tutoring class.

08:56.920 --> 08:57.970
Me too.

08:58.530 --> 08:59.680
If we change seats next semester,

08:59.680 --> 09:01.210
I'm gonna sit in the last row.

09:01.210 --> 09:03.040
You're already in the second to last row.

09:05.290 --> 09:06.330
That's different.

09:06.850 --> 09:08.330
If we change seats next semester...

09:12.040 --> 09:14.330
We're gonna have to change seats next semester.

09:15.530 --> 09:17.360
Don't think about this mess.

09:17.920 --> 09:19.330
Go home and have a rest.

09:19.600 --> 09:20.770
Don't burn your brain

09:20.970 --> 09:22.240
before next semester begins.

09:22.800 --> 09:23.850
Let's go.

09:24.040 --> 09:25.560
That's a good thing.

09:25.560 --> 09:27.530
I don't have to take the test.

09:34.210 --> 09:34.890
Let's go.

09:53.410 --> 09:54.410
Ding Xian

09:54.850 --> 09:56.850
Siyue comes to deliver your homework.

10:05.210 --> 10:06.210
Come here, Siyue.

10:16.090 --> 10:17.330
Sorry, Siyue.

10:18.600 --> 10:19.650
It's okay, auntie.

10:19.800 --> 10:21.290
I'm just dropping off her homework.

10:21.970 --> 10:24.120
She was ill and missed the homecoming day.

10:24.440 --> 10:25.920
I'll tell her.

10:26.440 --> 10:27.290
Thank you for

10:27.440 --> 10:28.360
coming here in person.

10:28.560 --> 10:29.240
It doesn't matter.

10:29.410 --> 10:30.560
You can have a talk.

10:31.290 --> 10:32.090
OK.

10:58.360 --> 10:59.360
Your photos

11:00.330 --> 11:01.770
look very unique.

11:02.770 --> 11:04.530
You enter my room privately.

11:04.730 --> 11:05.890
I don't care about it.

11:06.330 --> 11:07.480
Don't look around.

11:08.040 --> 11:09.480
Come on, you're not well yet.

11:09.890 --> 11:10.970
Have a rest.

11:14.090 --> 11:15.040
Sit down please.

11:22.480 --> 11:23.410
Don't look around.

11:36.170 --> 11:37.480
I told you not to look around.

11:41.770 --> 11:42.680
You...

11:43.170 --> 11:44.410
Is there anything

11:44.560 --> 11:46.170
you can't tell my mom?

11:46.440 --> 11:47.730
You have to come into my room.

11:48.170 --> 11:49.000
Of course.

11:49.680 --> 11:51.170
Then I'll tell your mother.

11:51.850 --> 11:53.210
I'll give this report card directly

11:53.410 --> 11:54.680
to your mother.

11:54.920 --> 11:55.800
No, no.

11:56.330 --> 11:57.530
Let me see

11:58.290 --> 12:00.440
the report card first.

12:00.850 --> 12:01.800
Your report card,

12:03.330 --> 12:04.290
homework,

12:05.480 --> 12:06.530
and notes.

12:06.730 --> 12:07.730
They're all here.

12:15.440 --> 12:16.330
It's all right.

12:16.530 --> 12:17.970
It's not as bad as you think.

12:22.360 --> 12:24.090
It's good to get this result

12:24.360 --> 12:25.730
with illness.

12:31.680 --> 12:33.650
Do you want to know how many points I got?

12:36.800 --> 12:37.770
Forget it.

12:37.970 --> 12:39.410
Don't stimulate me

12:39.600 --> 12:41.040
with your performance.

12:42.850 --> 12:45.600
Well, I won't tell you.

12:46.800 --> 12:48.730
Anyway, you should take care of your illness first.

12:49.240 --> 12:50.240
If I have nothing to do

12:50.480 --> 12:51.290
this holiday,

12:51.440 --> 12:52.770
I'll come and make up a missed lesson for you.

12:53.040 --> 12:54.800
Your math is not good enough.

12:57.730 --> 13:00.040
I'm going back to my hometown

13:00.730 --> 13:02.040
this Spring Festival.

13:05.240 --> 13:07.240
I didn't know about it until a few days ago.

13:23.120 --> 13:24.170
This is my phone number.

13:24.650 --> 13:26.360
If you have any problems that you can't understand,

13:26.530 --> 13:27.850
you can call me.

13:29.240 --> 13:30.360
I'm leaving.

13:30.560 --> 13:31.480
Thank you.

13:36.890 --> 13:38.040
See you next semester,

13:38.560 --> 13:39.480
my deskmate.

13:41.290 --> 13:42.360
See you.

13:49.210 --> 13:50.210
My deskmate...

14:02.000 --> 14:02.970
I'm back.

14:03.240 --> 14:04.240
You're back.

14:05.410 --> 14:06.890
You have already started to decorate.

14:10.440 --> 14:11.330
Let me help you.

14:11.890 --> 14:12.800
OK.

14:13.530 --> 14:14.730
Pack some red envelopes.

14:19.800 --> 14:20.770
Look.

14:21.480 --> 14:24.850
This year is cold and cheerless again.

14:25.600 --> 14:27.890
Your father has to come back on Chinese New Year's Eve.

14:28.290 --> 14:29.210
He is always busy

14:29.800 --> 14:31.240
every year.

14:31.440 --> 14:33.440
There are so many exhibitions.

14:34.850 --> 14:36.890
How could he be so busy?

14:37.330 --> 14:39.000
I think it's good.

14:39.360 --> 14:41.330
You like to be cold and cheerless

14:41.730 --> 14:42.730
instead of excitement.

14:42.920 --> 14:44.560
You're right.

14:46.330 --> 14:47.680
But I'm getting old.

14:48.240 --> 14:50.850
It is inevitable to be lonely when the house is cold and cheerless.

14:51.650 --> 14:52.730
Now

14:53.120 --> 14:55.040
I miss the past.

14:55.330 --> 14:57.410
It's lively for a large family

14:57.650 --> 14:58.770
to celebrate the New Year together.

14:59.850 --> 15:00.800
By the way,

15:01.330 --> 15:02.440
a few days ago,

15:02.770 --> 15:04.680
I heard that it seems that Uncle Ding and his family

15:04.890 --> 15:06.530
are going back to their hometown for the New Year.

15:07.000 --> 15:09.560
Yeah. Xianxian's mother told me

15:09.560 --> 15:11.090
when I met her.

15:11.360 --> 15:12.240
What's the matter?

15:14.890 --> 15:17.480
Do you know the telephone number of their hometown?

15:18.090 --> 15:19.530
Ding Xian doesn't have a cell phone.

15:19.770 --> 15:22.210
If I find her, I can only call her parents.

15:22.410 --> 15:23.360
It's quite troublesome.

15:24.800 --> 15:27.850
You usually don't bother to say one more word to others.

15:28.330 --> 15:29.290
What do you want to

15:29.600 --> 15:31.410
talk to her alone?

15:36.530 --> 15:37.210
No.

15:38.290 --> 15:41.040
No, it's not me.

15:41.410 --> 15:42.770
It's Kong Shadi.

15:44.410 --> 15:45.040
They girls

15:45.240 --> 15:46.890
like talking on the phone.

15:47.090 --> 15:48.650
So she asks me to inquire.

15:49.120 --> 15:50.360
I'm not looking for her.

16:00.410 --> 16:01.650
You buy so many flowers.

16:05.440 --> 16:07.530
This orange is good.

16:09.600 --> 16:11.210
But it seems better to put it here.

16:12.240 --> 16:13.090
Right?

16:14.410 --> 16:15.360
Leave it there.

16:16.600 --> 16:18.530
I'll ask about it for you later.

16:26.890 --> 16:28.290
It's really not asked by me.

16:48.210 --> 16:49.000
Xianxian

16:49.170 --> 16:50.800
Can you help Su put up the couplets?

16:51.170 --> 16:52.410
Pick up the vegetables for me later.

16:52.600 --> 16:53.090
OK.

16:53.920 --> 16:54.730
I'm coming.

16:55.170 --> 16:56.360
OK, just in time.

16:56.600 --> 16:58.210
Let me see if you have grown taller this year.

17:05.360 --> 17:06.770
Aren't you embarrassing me?

17:06.959 --> 17:08.530
How could I touch it?

17:09.770 --> 17:12.530
It's not that difficult.

17:13.930 --> 17:16.200
You are tall. Of course you can touch it.

17:17.410 --> 17:19.360
Okay, you're right.

17:20.200 --> 17:22.410
Come on. You paste the Fu character.

17:23.450 --> 17:24.570
I'll watch it for you.

17:26.999 --> 17:28.600
A little bit down.

17:28.690 --> 17:29.840
A little more to the right. Okay.

17:30.000 --> 17:30.600
Good.

17:33.000 --> 17:33.890
It's OK, Xianxian.

17:42.600 --> 17:43.600
By the way, Xianxian,

17:43.840 --> 17:45.240
I haven't had time to ask you.

17:45.480 --> 17:47.080
How was your first semester?

17:47.290 --> 17:49.450
Have you been overwhelmed by Shen Hai High School?

17:49.600 --> 17:50.690
Of course not.

17:54.120 --> 17:54.960
But

17:55.600 --> 17:57.360
I'm a little worried.

17:58.770 --> 18:00.530
I didn't do well in the final exam.

18:01.570 --> 18:03.360
It's a bit uncomfortable

18:04.450 --> 18:05.770
to think of changing the deskmate.

18:07.410 --> 18:09.650
Your seats are arranged according to your academic performance.

18:10.120 --> 18:12.170
Do you feel the pressure?

18:14.810 --> 18:16.770
I actually expected it all.

18:18.360 --> 18:21.290
I can't keep up with other classmates.

18:23.360 --> 18:24.600
Unlike my deskmate,

18:25.120 --> 18:26.450
he is the champion of National Olympiad Mathematics.

18:27.080 --> 18:29.170
He can do everything easily.

18:30.960 --> 18:32.770
You can't think so.

18:33.200 --> 18:35.120
Many people work hard secretly

18:35.320 --> 18:36.290
in places you can't see.

18:36.530 --> 18:38.840
He didn't work hard secretly.

18:40.050 --> 18:41.480
He plays basketball and games.

18:41.720 --> 18:43.000
None of them are left behind.

18:43.410 --> 18:47.360
But he still learns everything very well.

18:52.450 --> 18:55.170
Why do you always mention your deskmate?

18:57.570 --> 18:58.450
Am I?

18:59.200 --> 19:00.000
Yes.

19:00.650 --> 19:01.600
No.

19:03.600 --> 19:05.240
We are all classmates.

19:07.810 --> 19:08.810
Are you two just classmates?

19:13.690 --> 19:14.960
Okay, I'm not kidding you.

19:15.570 --> 19:16.890
Let's go out and set off firecrackers later.

19:19.170 --> 19:20.000
Today...

19:20.240 --> 19:21.170
Forget it.

19:23.320 --> 19:24.320
I remember you loved setting off firecrackers

19:24.530 --> 19:26.050
when you were young.

19:26.930 --> 19:28.290
I think

19:28.840 --> 19:30.840
it's also good to spend the New Year at home.

19:31.960 --> 19:34.000
Why don't you take my brother?

19:37.600 --> 19:38.600
Ding Xian,

19:38.770 --> 19:39.770
still not ready yet?

19:40.600 --> 19:41.450
It's done.

19:43.290 --> 19:44.170
Ding Juncong

19:44.570 --> 19:45.690
Put down what you're holding.

19:45.890 --> 19:46.770
Who allows you to eat?

19:47.290 --> 19:48.080
Thank you, Su.

19:48.650 --> 19:49.650
Coming, aunt.

19:52.770 --> 19:56.000
Why do you always mention your deskmate?

20:09.000 --> 20:10.200
Zhou Zongtang

20:11.080 --> 20:12.600
You finally come back.

20:12.930 --> 20:14.290
You're still reading your books.

20:14.770 --> 20:15.650
Can't you spend a year happily

20:15.690 --> 20:17.320
with us?

20:17.840 --> 20:19.890
I've always been reluctant to join in this kind of thing.

20:20.200 --> 20:21.530
You know it.

20:21.810 --> 20:23.650
I don't see you a few times a year.

20:23.960 --> 20:25.410
You still feel you're right.

20:25.650 --> 20:27.320
I've told you so many times.

20:27.890 --> 20:30.000
You two move to Jiangling with me.

20:30.200 --> 20:31.170
Wouldn't it be better?

20:32.200 --> 20:33.200
I'm not going.

20:33.600 --> 20:35.050
I'm fine here.

20:35.240 --> 20:36.770
Why do I have to move to Jiangling?

20:37.170 --> 20:38.600
Why don't you move back?

20:39.410 --> 20:40.360
Our son says that

20:40.570 --> 20:42.120
he doesn't mind where to stay.

20:42.320 --> 20:44.240
You just want to stay here.

20:45.120 --> 20:46.480
I'm not moving.

20:49.930 --> 20:51.650
During the summer vacation, you tell me

20:51.840 --> 20:52.810
anywhere is okay.

20:53.720 --> 20:54.840
I changed my mind.

20:55.600 --> 20:57.050
Shen Hai High School is quite good.

20:58.480 --> 20:59.770
Come on.

21:00.200 --> 21:01.600
Our son and I,

21:01.840 --> 21:03.320
we both like Shen Hai High School.

21:03.690 --> 21:05.530
You are the only one who likes Jiangling.

21:06.050 --> 21:06.930
Come on, my son.

21:08.290 --> 21:10.570
Okay, you two are right.

21:12.530 --> 21:14.720
It's Chinese New Year today. Don't be so serious.

21:18.450 --> 21:19.930
Add another dish.

21:21.650 --> 21:22.840
Come on, come on.

22:03.450 --> 22:06.080
Welcome the bright spring

22:06.080 --> 22:07.890
of the new year together.

22:08.240 --> 22:09.890
Countdown ten,

22:10.120 --> 22:12.450
nine, eight, seven,

22:12.810 --> 22:15.290
six, five, four,

22:15.480 --> 22:17.720
three, two, one.

22:19.240 --> 22:20.120
Xianxian

22:22.480 --> 22:23.050
hello

22:24.080 --> 22:24.770
hello

22:27.530 --> 22:28.570
Happy New Year!

22:32.770 --> 22:33.840
Happy New Year!

22:40.720 --> 22:41.650
By the way,

22:41.930 --> 22:44.120
how did you do in that exam?

22:44.570 --> 22:46.120
Now you want to know.

22:47.120 --> 22:48.690
But I won't tell you.

22:49.960 --> 22:51.480
Forget it.

22:51.890 --> 22:52.890
Anyway,

22:54.000 --> 22:55.690
I'll know when school starts.

22:56.170 --> 22:59.290
OK, you'll know when school starts.

23:04.050 --> 23:05.890
All right, go to rest.

23:06.120 --> 23:07.200
I'll hang up.

23:08.080 --> 23:09.690
See you, my deskmate.

23:10.960 --> 23:12.050
See you at school.

23:33.170 --> 23:34.840
Eat more, Ding Juncong

23:35.720 --> 23:37.360
Come on, my granddaughter.

23:37.530 --> 23:38.410
Grandma, happy New Year!

23:38.570 --> 23:39.240
Happy New Year!

23:39.360 --> 23:40.170
Come on, let's have a toast.

23:40.290 --> 23:41.320
Let's have a toast. Come on.

23:41.530 --> 23:42.360
Let's have a toast.

23:42.450 --> 23:44.080
Happy New Year! Happy New Year!

23:44.320 --> 23:45.360
Everything goes well!

24:06.930 --> 24:07.840
Don't need to look.

24:08.120 --> 24:09.200
The seat has not changed.

24:11.450 --> 24:12.480
You don't believe me.

24:23.810 --> 24:24.840
It hasn't changed.

24:25.720 --> 24:26.810
It really hasn't changed.

24:43.960 --> 24:45.290
You're so procrastinating.

24:47.570 --> 24:49.600
Why are you still my deskmate?

24:49.810 --> 24:51.690
It hurts me when you say that.

24:52.290 --> 24:54.450
When I said I didn't want to change my deskmate,

24:54.450 --> 24:55.720
I'm very sincere.

24:56.450 --> 24:57.600
If I had known my mouth was so useful,

24:57.770 --> 24:59.170
I should say I wanted to sit with Yang Chunzi.

25:00.000 --> 25:01.320
You don't deserve it.

25:03.050 --> 25:04.530
Yes, you're right.

25:04.840 --> 25:06.290
So I sit next to you.

25:06.930 --> 25:08.480
So you mean I don't deserve it, right?

25:08.650 --> 25:09.240
No, no, no.

25:09.410 --> 25:11.120
I'm following your words.

25:11.290 --> 25:14.200
I have a good heart to take you in.

25:14.600 --> 25:15.570
Yes, yes, yes.

25:16.200 --> 25:17.170
I overstepped my authority.

25:17.770 --> 25:19.240
You are a fairy who descends to earth.

25:19.450 --> 25:20.690
You are the princess who comes to the south of the Yangtze River.

25:21.200 --> 25:22.200
As a pleb,

25:22.410 --> 25:23.600
I should greet you.

25:24.200 --> 25:25.530
That sounds good.

25:32.930 --> 25:33.930
What's up?

25:35.360 --> 25:36.050
I told you

25:36.240 --> 25:37.450
we can still be deskmates.

25:40.240 --> 25:41.320
Really?

25:42.480 --> 25:44.840
Your score is almost the same as mine.

26:09.600 --> 26:11.720
You didn't mean to fail the exam, did you?

26:13.450 --> 26:14.320
It's not right.

26:14.480 --> 26:16.120
How do I get your score...

26:16.290 --> 26:17.450
I can know your score

26:18.000 --> 26:19.720
without thinking.

26:20.690 --> 26:22.770
You really failed the exam for me.

26:23.930 --> 26:24.930
What?

26:25.410 --> 26:26.690
What for you?

26:26.840 --> 26:28.200
I promised you to be your deskmate.

26:28.450 --> 26:29.930
I definitely have to keep my word.

26:41.240 --> 26:42.450
I did fairly well

26:42.600 --> 26:44.080
in the math test.

26:45.290 --> 26:47.890
Let me treat you this weekend.

26:50.530 --> 26:52.290
I'll see if I have time.

27:04.890 --> 27:06.290
That's too much.

27:07.930 --> 27:09.840
I have to thank you deeply.

27:10.650 --> 27:12.200
You've been tutoring me with my lessons wherever you are.

27:12.410 --> 27:13.810
It makes my head bigger.

27:15.770 --> 27:17.120
You still have some conscience.

27:21.000 --> 27:22.200
It's okay

27:22.410 --> 27:23.720
to have a good meal, right?

27:24.960 --> 27:28.650
After all, today is my birthday.

27:40.930 --> 27:41.960
Happy birthday!

27:44.690 --> 27:45.530
Thank you.

27:47.960 --> 27:49.810
What birthday gift do you want?

27:56.890 --> 27:57.840
Have you finished eating?

27:59.770 --> 28:01.690
Let's go. I'll take you to a place.

28:04.000 --> 28:05.000
Where are we going?

28:14.240 --> 28:16.290
Why do you bring me here?

28:16.720 --> 28:17.690
Give me a second.

28:21.120 --> 28:22.050
Mr. Liu

28:22.810 --> 28:24.050
Siyue

28:24.290 --> 28:25.360
Long time no see.

28:25.570 --> 28:26.290
Long time no see.

28:26.450 --> 28:27.480
How is your father recently?

28:27.720 --> 28:28.720
He's still the same.

28:31.770 --> 28:33.690
By the way, Mr. Liu,

28:34.320 --> 28:36.170
could you please do me a favor?

28:36.600 --> 28:37.530
Tell me.

28:42.480 --> 28:44.200
Why you bring me here?

28:44.450 --> 28:45.240
Wait a minute.

28:47.050 --> 28:48.770
So mysterious.

28:54.170 --> 28:55.120
Zhou Siyue

28:56.290 --> 28:58.810
Why do you want to be my deskmate?

29:01.960 --> 29:03.810
Come on, compliment me.

29:05.000 --> 29:06.080
Because you're stupid.

29:09.600 --> 29:10.320
Play by yourself.

29:10.480 --> 29:11.290
I'm going home.

29:16.410 --> 29:17.410
All I can say is that

29:18.960 --> 29:20.650
there is no pressure to be your deskmate.

29:22.720 --> 29:24.530
You don't care how many marks I get.

29:25.240 --> 29:26.930
You won't ask me

29:27.080 --> 29:28.360
how late I learn at night.

29:28.890 --> 29:29.890
You won't tell me

29:30.570 --> 29:31.570
I'm wasting my time

29:31.770 --> 29:33.320
in those competitions.

29:34.410 --> 29:35.840
You don't care about me,

29:36.240 --> 29:37.960
so I feel very relaxed.

29:40.690 --> 29:43.360
I thought you're not afraid of anything.

29:43.690 --> 29:44.890
I'm not afraid.

29:45.360 --> 29:46.890
I just feel annoyed.

29:50.890 --> 29:51.720
All right.

29:53.650 --> 29:54.690
Stand there.

29:55.290 --> 29:56.000
There?

29:56.170 --> 29:57.050
Stand in the middle.

30:22.690 --> 30:23.690
This is...

30:23.930 --> 30:25.890
The nebula map on your birthday.

30:26.650 --> 30:28.050
On my birthday?

30:29.890 --> 30:31.290
It's your universe.

30:39.890 --> 30:41.770
What about yours?

30:42.530 --> 30:43.410
Do you want to see it?

30:47.720 --> 30:48.600
Wait a minute.

31:02.170 --> 31:03.320
How beautiful!

31:07.600 --> 31:09.080
I really want to have a star

31:10.170 --> 31:11.890
that never fades.

31:14.570 --> 31:16.000
You dare to think about this.

31:25.080 --> 31:26.480
No star

31:26.960 --> 31:28.480
will never fade.

31:29.410 --> 31:32.050
They are all a flash in the pan in the universe.

31:33.000 --> 31:34.450
But just like the universe,

31:35.290 --> 31:36.650
in everyone's life,

31:37.290 --> 31:39.770
there will be many stars.

31:40.240 --> 31:42.290
Although they look ordinary,

31:43.770 --> 31:46.290
after they took tens of millions of light years

31:46.890 --> 31:48.810
to form a unique nebula,

31:49.890 --> 31:52.810
everything will make sense.

32:21.960 --> 32:24.000
Happy birthday, Xianxian.

32:25.050 --> 32:26.530
This gift is a little late.

32:26.690 --> 32:27.650
Do you mind?

32:27.840 --> 32:28.770
Of course not.

32:29.000 --> 32:29.720
Thank you.

32:29.930 --> 32:30.840
Open it and have a look.

32:32.770 --> 32:34.410
I have an identical one.

32:34.600 --> 32:37.000
We can use the same style in the future.

32:37.810 --> 32:39.770
No, this is too expensive.

32:39.960 --> 32:40.720
I can't accept it.

32:40.930 --> 32:41.770
Not expensive.

32:42.170 --> 32:43.050
Besides,

32:43.290 --> 32:44.810
don't you want to use the same style with me?

32:45.240 --> 32:45.960
It's really...

32:46.200 --> 32:47.410
Just take it.

32:48.200 --> 32:50.200
Just take it. It's all right.

32:51.810 --> 32:52.960
Open it and have a look.

32:54.120 --> 32:55.530
Thank you, Shadi.

32:55.890 --> 32:56.890
That's very kind of you.

32:58.000 --> 33:00.050
Let's go and beat down those in Class 1.

33:00.930 --> 33:01.930
It relies on your performance.

33:02.080 --> 33:02.690
Of course.

33:02.890 --> 33:03.720
Stop.

33:03.960 --> 33:05.410
We are on duty today.

33:05.690 --> 33:06.890
You're not forgetting, are you?

33:11.240 --> 33:11.770
What should we do?

33:11.960 --> 33:13.600
We made an appointment to play at 5:30.

33:14.600 --> 33:15.720
Let them wait.

33:15.960 --> 33:16.450
You're funny.

33:16.600 --> 33:17.890
They will say we don't have the spirit of contract.

33:18.050 --> 33:18.770
I am called Kobe of Shen Hai High School.

33:18.930 --> 33:20.170
You don't care but I care.

33:21.000 --> 33:22.360
Then you can go by yourself.

33:23.200 --> 33:24.960
Bro, how can I play by myself?

33:25.170 --> 33:28.600
I'll help you on duty.

33:31.080 --> 33:32.960
Then it's decided so happily.

33:33.690 --> 33:35.320
Ding Xian, you're cool.

33:35.600 --> 33:37.450
Does she say that she helps you?

33:37.650 --> 33:39.810
She helps Zhou Siyue on duty.

33:48.240 --> 33:49.120
My dear deskmate,

33:50.290 --> 33:51.600
just help me this time.

33:52.290 --> 33:54.080
I'll treat you when I get back.

33:54.240 --> 33:55.720
I'll help when you are on duty from now on.

33:55.840 --> 33:56.720
OK?

33:57.000 --> 33:57.960
It's OK.

33:58.480 --> 34:00.480
But you have to help me do all the duty this semester.

34:03.840 --> 34:04.650
OK.

34:05.240 --> 34:06.000
I will.

34:06.240 --> 34:06.960
Go ahead.

34:07.290 --> 34:08.890
Okay, go ahead.

34:12.410 --> 34:14.410
Xianxian, you are too kind.

34:14.690 --> 34:16.170
You shouldn't spoil men.

34:17.450 --> 34:19.010
All right, let's do the duty.

34:23.319 --> 34:25.490
He just took you to a planetarium.

34:26.080 --> 34:27.799
I think the planetarium is quite good.

34:28.040 --> 34:29.279
It's quite romantic.

34:29.970 --> 34:31.210
That's boring.

34:34.930 --> 34:35.890
By the way, Shadi,

34:36.080 --> 34:37.560
I drew a picture for Zhou Siyue.

34:37.799 --> 34:39.760
Can you help me see if the painting is good?

34:39.970 --> 34:40.650
OK.

34:49.450 --> 34:50.359
You take a look.

34:53.080 --> 34:54.359
I know you draw quite well.

34:54.890 --> 34:56.690
But I don't expect it to be so beautiful.

34:56.890 --> 34:57.839
Really?

34:58.650 --> 34:59.560
It's so pretty.

35:00.520 --> 35:02.040
Hello, are you Ding Xian?

35:02.890 --> 35:03.800
What's the matter?

35:04.490 --> 35:05.970
Can you do me a favor?

35:06.890 --> 35:07.840
What?

35:08.450 --> 35:10.520
Give this to Zhou Siyue for me.

35:11.120 --> 35:12.450
I'll leave it to you.

35:12.760 --> 35:14.010
I'll invite you to dinner.

35:14.650 --> 35:15.490
Thanks.

35:18.320 --> 35:19.250
You're stupid.

35:19.600 --> 35:21.280
Why don't you just refuse her?

35:23.170 --> 35:25.450
To Zhou Siyue...

35:26.730 --> 35:28.170
She's so direct.

35:28.410 --> 35:30.040
Does Zhou Siyue know her?

35:31.800 --> 35:33.490
What should I do now?

35:34.210 --> 35:34.890
Don't worry.

35:35.040 --> 35:36.600
Why don't you just tear it up?

35:37.170 --> 35:39.250
How can you tear other people's letters?

35:39.490 --> 35:40.970
Why can't?

35:42.360 --> 35:44.040
You dare not tear it. I'll tear it for you.

35:44.520 --> 35:46.360
Kong Shadi, what are you doing?

35:46.600 --> 35:48.410
What do I do? Why are you yelling at me?

35:48.520 --> 35:50.560
How can you tear other people's letter?

35:50.730 --> 35:52.560
How can I tell Zhou Siyue?

35:52.730 --> 35:54.040
You still want to talk to him.

35:54.210 --> 35:54.800
We don't tell him.

35:54.930 --> 35:55.970
Will he know?

35:56.120 --> 35:57.280
I'm doing this for you.

35:57.650 --> 35:59.450
Besides, do you know who she is?

35:59.730 --> 36:00.890
You Keke

36:01.280 --> 36:03.490
A famous girl in our school.

36:03.730 --> 36:05.320
She always plays with boys.

36:06.280 --> 36:08.080
And if you give this letter to Zhou Siyue,

36:08.360 --> 36:09.520
there will be one more girl around him.

36:09.690 --> 36:10.650
Don't you care?

36:11.170 --> 36:12.930
That's his own business.

36:14.210 --> 36:15.120
OK.

36:15.320 --> 36:16.520
I stop you from being silly.

36:16.730 --> 36:17.800
You also yell at me.

36:18.280 --> 36:20.320
Ding Xian, you really have no conscience.

36:20.690 --> 36:21.930
Whether I'm stupid or not,

36:22.080 --> 36:22.840
tearing up other people's letter

36:23.040 --> 36:24.600
is immoral.

36:24.890 --> 36:26.360
Immoral?

36:30.650 --> 36:31.520
Others can't see it.

36:31.730 --> 36:32.930
But I can see it.

36:33.840 --> 36:34.890
I did what you wanted to do most

36:35.040 --> 36:36.280
in your heart,

36:36.840 --> 36:38.010
didn't I?

36:39.450 --> 36:40.650
You still don't admit it.

36:57.730 --> 36:58.800
Let's go home. Finished cleaning?

37:07.250 --> 37:08.490
I'm leaving.

37:11.320 --> 37:12.450
Won't you wait for them?

37:12.600 --> 37:13.560
You can wait if you like.

37:16.840 --> 37:18.080
Then I'll go. Bye.

37:21.690 --> 37:22.760
What's wrong with her?

37:25.490 --> 37:26.360
What's up?

37:55.490 --> 37:56.490
Zhou Siyue

37:58.970 --> 38:01.730
Let's go separately in the future.

38:03.520 --> 38:05.010
What's the matter?

38:05.730 --> 38:07.250
You get angry when you're on duty.

38:08.560 --> 38:11.360
I'm afraid others will think we're too close.

38:13.040 --> 38:14.280
This would create a bad impression.

38:18.120 --> 38:18.840
OK.

38:38.280 --> 38:39.280
Others can't see it.

38:39.320 --> 38:40.600
But I can see it.

38:40.840 --> 38:41.970
I did what you wanted to do most

38:42.010 --> 38:43.210
in your heart.

38:43.840 --> 38:44.930
You still don't admit it.

38:46.800 --> 38:48.120
Did I deny it?

38:48.360 --> 38:49.650
I just think

38:49.930 --> 38:52.080
people around him

38:52.080 --> 38:53.560
are all better than me.

39:16.040 --> 39:17.490
This really tastes bad.

39:18.970 --> 39:20.080
What do I say?

39:20.730 --> 39:21.970
I say you don't know if it tastes good.

39:22.120 --> 39:24.120
You should buy less. You're wasting money.

39:24.280 --> 39:25.410
I have to buy it to eat

39:25.560 --> 39:27.080
before I know if it tastes good.

39:27.250 --> 39:28.520
How can I know if I don't try?

39:28.800 --> 39:29.560
False reasoning.

39:31.890 --> 39:32.520
Little Monster,

39:32.730 --> 39:33.600
do you have breakfast?

39:34.250 --> 39:35.120
You can judge it.

39:35.280 --> 39:36.250
Do you think this thing is delicious

39:36.410 --> 39:37.800
or not?  Give it to me.

39:42.650 --> 39:43.930
What's wrong with you two?

40:07.080 --> 40:08.010
What is this?

40:08.930 --> 40:10.120
Let me have a look.

40:11.840 --> 40:12.730
That's cool.

40:13.120 --> 40:14.890
Someone confessed to you so soon?

40:14.890 --> 40:15.890
Let me take another look.

40:16.560 --> 40:17.320
Stop.

40:19.040 --> 40:19.930
There is a problem.

40:20.450 --> 40:21.210
You used to throw away such things

40:21.360 --> 40:22.690
at a glance.

40:23.170 --> 40:24.490
Why are you hiding this time?

40:24.690 --> 40:26.080
There is different... Don't bother me.

40:27.840 --> 40:28.800
You're so boring.

40:31.690 --> 40:32.890
Do you know what I saw

40:33.010 --> 40:33.730
in Zhou Siyue's drawer?

40:33.760 --> 40:34.840
Why are you telling me?

40:35.450 --> 40:36.890
Don't you have a good relationship with Ding Xian?

40:37.250 --> 40:38.250
You should tell her.

40:42.040 --> 40:44.210
Are you all taking the wrong medicine today?

41:06.120 --> 41:06.840
Deng Wanwan

41:08.080 --> 41:09.450
Let's have lunch together.

41:09.450 --> 41:10.120
OK.

41:10.320 --> 41:11.760
I heard that there is braised pork in the second canteen today.

41:11.970 --> 41:13.010
Hurry up.

41:13.170 --> 41:14.040
It's sold out in a while.

41:14.250 --> 41:15.120
OK, let's go.

41:22.890 --> 41:24.320
Did you two quarrel?

41:26.040 --> 41:26.650
It doesn't matter.

41:26.970 --> 41:28.560
I have quarreled with her many times.

41:28.600 --> 41:29.210
I know her.

41:29.210 --> 41:30.170
She is like this.

41:30.280 --> 41:31.490
She'll come back to you

41:31.690 --> 41:32.840
when she's relieved of her anger.

41:32.970 --> 41:33.650
Really?

41:33.730 --> 41:34.280
Yes.

41:37.170 --> 41:38.010
Thank you.

41:38.120 --> 41:38.760
It's all right.

41:39.760 --> 41:41.320
Let's have lunch.

41:42.520 --> 41:43.320
Will you go?

41:44.360 --> 41:45.280
You can go first.

41:45.450 --> 41:47.120
I haven't finished my notes yet.

41:48.410 --> 41:49.080
Let's go.

41:56.080 --> 41:56.730
All right, class.

41:56.890 --> 41:58.490
Let's do another physical fitness test.

41:59.010 --> 42:01.250
Boys and girls all do sit-ups.

42:01.600 --> 42:03.120
Team up freely in pairs.

42:03.360 --> 42:05.210
Count for each other, okay?

42:06.170 --> 42:06.730
Come on.

42:06.890 --> 42:07.890
You can find your partner

42:08.040 --> 42:08.840
and gather over there.

42:10.690 --> 42:12.080
Wanwan, let's go together.

42:12.280 --> 42:13.010
OK.

42:19.080 --> 42:20.520
Liu Xiaofeng, let's team up.

42:20.690 --> 42:21.760
OK. Let's go.

42:22.120 --> 42:22.970
What are you doing? Hurry up.

42:23.120 --> 42:24.040
Go to play basketball after we're done.

42:33.280 --> 42:34.010
OK.

42:41.930 --> 42:43.040
Ding Xian, come on.

42:46.840 --> 42:47.730
Come on, Ding Xian.
